OL,3,GNEWSAFree Christmas toy exchange
OL,4,Alooking for new home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group is looking for a new venue to
OL,7,Fhost its free toy exchange in time for
OL,8,FChristmas.
OL,10,FThe Darlington Toy Exchange was started
OL,11,Fby Macauley Macdonald and his partner
OL,12,Flast year with hundreds of items
OL,13,Fdonated and taken from their stall in
OL,14,Fthe town's covered market.
OL,16,FDarlington Market, which gave the group
OL,17,Fthe space for free, ended its
OL,18,Farrangement earlier this month, saying
OL,19,Fit could no longer accommodate the
OL,20,Fenhanced security needed for the
OL,21,Funmanned stall.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,393,390,260,160,0,100
